# Visual Studio 2022: her istegin ustundeki "Send request" baglantisina tiklayarak calistirin.
@host = http://localhost:5127
@apiKey = dev-api-key-change-me-please

### Saglik kontrolu (anahtar gerekmez)
GET {{host}}/health

### Kaynaklari listele
GET {{host}}/api/news-sources
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### RSS/Atom kaynagi ekle: Birlesik Krallik vize ve goc idaresi (GOV.UK resmi Atom beslemesi)
POST {{host}}/api/news-sources
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "UK Visas and Immigration",
  "url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/uk-visas-and-immigration.atom",
  "type": "Rss",
  "fetchIntervalMinutes": 30
}

### RSS kaynagi ekle: ABD Disisleri seyahat uyarilari (resmi RSS)
POST {{host}}/api/news-sources
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "US State Department Travel Advisories",
  "url": "https://travel.state.gov/_res/rss/TAsTWs.xml",
  "type": "Rss",
  "fetchIntervalMinutes": 60
}

### HTML kaynagi ekle (seciciler hedef siteye gore duzenlenmeli)
POST {{host}}/api/news-sources
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ornek HTML Duyuru Sayfasi",
  "url": "https://example.com/duyurular",
  "type": "Html",
  "fetchIntervalMinutes": 30,
  "parsingRules": {
    "itemSelector": "article.news-item",
    "titleSelector": "h2",
    "linkSelector": "a",
    "summarySelector": "p.summary",
    "publishedAtSelector": "time"
  }
}

### Kaynagi hemen cek (id'yi yukaridaki yanittan kopyalayin)
@sourceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{host}}/api/news-sources/{{sourceId}}/fetch
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Kaynagi pasife al
POST {{host}}/api/news-sources/{{sourceId}}/deactivate
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Kuyruktaki haberler
GET {{host}}/api/news-items?status=Pending&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Basarisiz haberler
GET {{host}}/api/news-items?status=Failed
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Haberi tekrar kuyruga al
@newsItemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{host}}/api/news-items/{{newsItemId}}/requeue
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
